---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="404 — 页面未找到"
    description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。请返回小火箭评测智库首页或查看42家机场品牌库。"
>
    <section class="section section-hero" aria-labelledby="not-found-heading">
        <div class="container has-text-centered">
            <p class="tag is-primary is-medium mb-4">404 NOT FOUND</p>
            <h1 id="not-found-heading" class="title is-1">
                网络信号中断 · 页面不存在
            </h1>
            <p class="subtitle is-4 mt-3 u-constrained has-text-grey-light">
                您访问的链接可能已经下线、移动或输入有误。您可以返回首页或前往核心评测数据库。
            </p>
            <div class="buttons is-centered mt-5">
                <a class="button is-primary is-medium has-text-weight-bold" href="/">
                    返回首页
                </a>
                <a class="button is-dark is-medium" href="/airports">
                    查看 42 家机场品牌库
                </a>
                <a class="button is-dark is-medium" href="/free">
                    免费资源避坑指南
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
